# Figures

A figure written as below opens at full size on click or tap: on a phone, the text of a
drawing is otherwise too small to read.

<figure class="figure"><a class="figure-zoom" href="assets/diagram.svg"><img src="assets/diagram.svg" alt="A circle and a square"></a><figcaption>A drawing, next to the page in assets/.</figcaption></figure>

```html
<figure class="figure"><a class="figure-zoom" href="assets/diagram.svg">
  <img src="assets/diagram.svg" alt="A circle and a square"></a>
  <figcaption>A drawing, next to the page in assets/.</figcaption></figure>
```
